{"sections":[{"slug":"乘法群概形","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"乘法群概形"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">乘法群概形</span>"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"subject":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/代数几何","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">代数几何</span>"}}]},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"乘法群概形"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">定义</span></h2>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">内语言</span></h3>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">用</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/Zariski意象","text":"Zariski <span lang=\"zh\">意象</span>"}},{"Plain":" $\\mathsf{Sh}(\\mathsf{Aff}_{\\mathrm{Zar}})$ <span lang=\"zh\">的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/意象的内语言","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">内语言</span>"}},{"Plain":",\n$$\r\n\\mathbb G_m = \\{x\\in \\mathbb A^1\\mid \\exists y\\in\\mathbb A^1, xy=1\\}.\r\n$$</p>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">作为仿射概形</span></h3>\n<p>$\\mathbb G_m$ <span lang=\"zh\">是</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/仿射概形","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">仿射概形</span>"}},{"Plain":" $\\operatorname{Spec}\\mathbb{Z}[x^{\\pm 1}]$.</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">性质</span></h2>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">群作用</span></h3>\n<p><strong><span lang=\"zh\">命题</span></strong>. "},{"Local":{"url":"/仿射概形","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">仿射概形</span>"}},{"Plain":" $\\operatorname{Spec} A$ <span lang=\"zh\">上的</span> $\\mathbb G_m$-<span lang=\"zh\">作用相当于</span> $A$ <span lang=\"zh\">上的一个</span> $\\mathbb{Z}$-"},{"Local":{"url":"/分次代数","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">分次</span>"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">见</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/fil-gr","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">滤与分次的叠观点</span>"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n"}]}}}]}